00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.150
Or he would send Kent Sabornak with his kid.

409
00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:49.650
Kent's kid was with him.

410
00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:53.270
And they would walk across the street and nonchalantly kind of tell John a note.

411
00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:57.890
And then so it looked like there were just people, pedestrians in Manhattan.

412
00:17:59.130 --> 00:17:59.610
Amazing.

413
00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:04.710
Because I guess they didn't want people to notice that they were filming because all those

414
00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.830
