So, first of all, there were actually two versions in the script for the ending of this episode.

1512
01:07:26.520 --> 01:07:30.360
There was this version with Jim interrupting my talking head.

1513
01:07:30.440 --> 01:07:33.400
And then there was a second version, which we shot.

